 sans-serif;">KAPOK KNOTのInstagramでもメンバーのチャレンジを発信していきます。</span></span></p><p style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial; text-align: left; padding-bottom: 1em; letter-spacing: 1px;"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><a href="https://www.instagram.com/kapok_knot_jp/" aria-describedby="a11y-external-message" style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204); text-decoration-line: underline; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span style="font-weight: 700;">@kapok_knot_jp</span></a>をタグ付けして<span style="font-weight: 700;">#kapokaction</span>で是非SNSに投稿お願いいたします！</span></span></p><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: inherit!important;"><font face="arial, helvetica, sans-serif"><br></font></p></div></div><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1636872253954" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1636872253954" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-exc=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/c4469987-ced9-4c1c-a68f-c3712919bc34/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/%E2%91%A8.png" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" width="2119" height="3000" data-width="70%" data-height="auto" title="" natural-width="2119" natural-height="3000"></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1636872339555" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1636872339555"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: center; font-size: 20px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><strong><br></strong></span></span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: center; font-size: 20px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><strong>東京・日本橋に完全予約制の新店舗</strong></span></span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: center;"><strong style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: center; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 20px;">「Farm to Fashion Base」をオープン</strong><br></p></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1636892077795" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1636892077795"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left" data-gemlang="en"><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: inherit!important;"><br></p><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: inherit!important;">KAPOK KNOTすべての商品をご試着いただける、新店舗を10月15日より東京・日本橋にオープンいたしました。<br>ブランドのコンセプトである「Farm to Fashion」を体感いただける場となっております。<br>皆さまのご来店お待ちしております。</p><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: inherit!important;"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><strong><br></strong></span></span></p><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: inherit!important;"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><strong>【店舗情報・来場予約方法】</strong><br>「Farm to Fashion Base」<br>住　　所：東京都中央区日本橋室町１丁目１０−１ 宮永ビル1階<br>アクセス：日本橋駅から徒歩５分、三越前駅から徒歩2分、東京駅から徒歩15分</span></span><br><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;">営業日時：金~日曜日 13:00~17:00</span></p><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: inherit!important;"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><br></span></span></p><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: inherit!important;"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">感染症対策のため、完全予約制となっております。<br>ご来店の際は、マスクの着用にご協力ください。<br>以下よりご予約をお願いいたします。</span></span></p><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: inherit!important;"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><br></span></span></p></div></div><div data-label="Button" data-key="button" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1636892116155" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-gpicon-button" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1636892116155"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-stretch-lg="0"><a class="button btn gf_button" href="https://kapok-knot.com/products/showroom" target="" data-scroll-speed="2000" data-exc=""><span>ご来店の予約はこちらから</span></a></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1636872289736" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1636872289736"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left" data-gemlang="en"><p style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial; padding-bottom: 1em; letter-spacing: 1px;"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><br></span></span></p><p style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial; padding-bottom: 1em; letter-spacing: 1px;"><br></p><div><span style="font-size: 14px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><br